2. Core Mission Directive

Build a complete, functional, secure, responsive web application named ClutterBox — Your Digital Clutter Organizer.

The application must help users organize saved website links, articles, videos, personal notes, ideas, and unfinished tasks in one centralized digital workspace.

The product must address a common problem: people continuously save digital content but frequently forget about it, lose track of useful resources, and accumulate an overwhelming collection of bookmarks and notes.

The application must transform digital clutter into actionable, organized information through categorization, search, reminders, forgotten-item detection, completion tracking, and optional AI-powered recommendations.

