Validate:

title: trimmed, nonempty, maximum 200 characters.
url: optional valid HTTP or HTTPS URL, maximum 2,048 characters.
description: optional string, maximum 20,000 characters.
category: read, do, or reference.
contentType: supported enumeration.
tags: array of strings, maximum 20 entries, maximum 40 characters per tag.

Reject unsupported fields or strip them deliberately using a documented policy.

Item Update Schema

Permit only fields users are authorized to modify.

Do not allow a request to modify user_id, created_at, or other server-managed fields.

Search Schema

Validate:

Search query length.
Pagination bounds.
Allowed sorting fields.
Sort direction.
Category and status filters.

Prevent arbitrary SQL fragments or unvalidated column names from entering queries.

Settings Schema

Require forgottenThresholdDays to be an integer in the configured allowed range.

AI Output Schemas

Validate:

Categorization response.
Organization recommendations.
Optional duplicate suggestions.

Reject malformed or unexpected AI output.

Return a controlled error or safe fallback instead of crashing.

Authentication and Authorization

Validate authentication tokens independently of ordinary request payload validation.

Never rely on Zod validation as a substitute for authorization or RLS.

